*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 6.67~23.33 seconds<sup>200f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
